-venancio-mondlane-faces-trial/a-79949795--64e48b90dff6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/mozambique-s-justice-under-scrutiny-as-venancio-mondlane-faces-trial/a-79949795?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The trial of opposition politician Venancio Mondlane begins in Mozambique on Tuesday. The former presidential candidate is facing five charges, including incitement to terrorism.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Modi heads to ASEAN meet in Manila</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ee5c8531cca7c46b7912b2c5229a2a533fe822eb91c3c5f007526de90f01ead2</id><updated>2026-11-16T18:41:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-16T06:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-modi-heads-to-asean-meet-in-manila/live-79954596--c03cc23c1c9b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-modi-heads-to-asean-meet-in-manila/live-79954596?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Modi is also likely to attend the Quad leaders' summit involving the US, Japan and Australia on the sidelines of the ASEAN meeting. Meanwhile, the Sabarimala temple has opened for an annual pilgrimage. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
